                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Productivity Index: of each person''s working hours (time off excluded), how much is tied to a project or a ticket, compared with what''s realistic for their team (PMO 90%, Apps 80%, Support 75%, Security 70%, Data 65%, Tech Ops 65%, DBA & special projects 20%; aligned to industry benchmarks). Admin, meetings and training up to 15% aren''t held against anyone. Directors are excluded. 100 = hitting the team target, which is the goal. Capacity FTE = hours that would need to shift to project/ticket work for everyone below 100 to reach it, shown as full-time people.'"
